{"id":"n89810-4-6","stage":3,"title":"향하다 · 朝向","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89810-4-6-1","ko":"시선을 정면으로 향하고 여기를 보세요. 사진 찍습니다.","zh":"请把视线看向正前方，看这里。我要拍照了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시선을","meaning":"视线","explanation":"시선：视线；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시선","audio":"/audio/e13568f722a5e0b607d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13965","senseId":"1","lemma":"시선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시선을","audio":"/audio/f974db3881f0595ebd62.mp3"}},{"text":"정면으로","meaning":"正面","explanation":"정면：正面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정면","audio":"/audio/a73ea5f9d58eed278d7a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31746","senseId":"3","lemma":"정면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정면으로","audio":"/audio/f436e4d42463dba74401.mp3"}},{"text":"향하고","meaning":"朝向","explanation":"향하다：朝向；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"향하다","audio":"/audio/970403cc9e5fad87e5ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89810","senseId":"4","lemma":"향하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"향하고","audio":"/audio/995937fdcfdc90d1d59c.mp3"}},{"text":"여기를","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기를","audio":"/audio/0d7cf0bf7ebdf10fd67d.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"찍습니다.","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍습니다","audio":"/audio/67bdad361febd2960d29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e13568f722a5e0b6","term":"시선","zh":"视线","audio":"/audio/e13568f722a5e0b607d4.mp3","entryId":"13965","definition":"望向某个方向的眼睛。","pronunciation":["시선"]},{"id":"a73ea5f9d58eed27","term":"정면","zh":"正面","audio":"/audio/a73ea5f9d58eed278d7a.mp3","entryId":"31746","definition":"直接面对。","pronunciation":["정ː면"]},{"id":"970403cc9e5fad87","term":"향하다","zh":"朝向","audio":"/audio/970403cc9e5fad87e5ad.mp3","entryId":"89810","definition":"某事向着某个方向看。","pronunciation":["향ː하다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/45c503cbe286db7f364a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89810-4-6-2","ko":"네, 이제 찍어 주세요.","zh":"好的，那现在开始拍吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"